MyLoAI Control Center
======================

The canonical binary Debian package is built by `build-deb.sh` in this
directory. It produces an amd64 `.deb` containing the native MyLoAI runtime
under `/opt/myloai`, with the executable at `/opt/myloai/MyLoAI_Control_Center`, with no separate Python installation required.

The installed desktop application is named MyLoAI Control Center and is
launched with the `myloai` command. The package desktop entry uses `Exec=myloai`.

The binary package contains only production runtime files, required resources,
redistribution notices, and concise user-facing documentation. Repository
archives, CI files, development prompts, tests, and historical code are not
included.

A supported LLM backend such as Ollama may be installed separately. MyLoAI
provides its own backend/model setup and diagnostics within the application.
